        },
        {
          "path": "_m/e/y/x/m/roman-theatre-cartagena-wp/20211116-ancient-roman-theatre-1.jpg",
          "filename": "20211116. Ancient Roman theatre in Cartagena.-019.jpg",
          "caption": "The theater was built between the 5th century &amp; the 1st century B.C.E.. In the 3rd century, a market was built above the theater, reusing its materials, with a semicircular open space that followed the plan of the orchestra. The market may have been abandoned after a fire by the Vandals in C.E.425. In the 6th century, a Byzantine market district was built on the site. During the 13th century, the city's Old Cathedral was built over the upper cavea. In C.E.1988, the first remains of the theater were discovered during the construction of the \"Centro regional de artesanía\". The archaeological excavations and restorations were completed in C.E.2003. In C.E.2008, a museum designed by Rafael Moneo was opened.",
          "alt": "The theater was built between the 5th century &amp; the 1st century B.C.E.. In the 3rd century, a market was built above the theater, reusing its materials, with a semicircular open space that followed the plan of the orchestra. The market may have been abandoned after a fire by the Vandals in C.E.425. In the 6th century, a Byzantine market district was built on the site. During the 13th century, the city's Old Cathedral was built over the upper cavea. In C.E.1988, the first remains of the theater were discovered during the construction of the \"Centro regional de artesanía\". The archaeological excavations and restorations were completed in C.E.2003. In C.E.2008, a museum designed by Rafael Moneo was opened.",
